# Base groups and users introduced by a release, with that release.
#
# base-accounts(8) has no record of what an installed system had before its
# first run, so on that run it creates only the missing accounts listed here:
# a system upgraded to this release cannot have had them.  Every other missing
# base account is taken to have been removed by the administrator and is
# recorded, not recreated.  Add an entry with every new account in
# etc/group or etc/master.passwd; remove entries once upgrades from the
# release before theirs are no longer supported.
#
# kind	name		release	origin
group	vmm		16.0	# FreeBSD: unprivileged bhyve
group	audio		16.0	# FreeBSD: sound devices root:audio 0660
group	capability	16.0	# 5BSD: capability plane identity
user	capability	16.0
group	_otel		16.0	# 5BSD: OpenTelemetry collector
user	_otel		16.0
